<title>USA: A.M Best puts Eagle Insurance under review.</title>
<headline>A.M Best puts Eagle Insurance under review.</headline>
<dateline>OLDWICK, N.J. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance rating firm A.M. Best Co said it has placed the &quot;BB++&quot; (very good) rating for Eagle Insurance Servicing Group under review with developing implications and the &quot;A&quot;  (excellent) rating for Newark Insurance Co under review with negative implications.</p>
<p>A.M. Best said the review was caused by the announced sale of Newark Insurance by Royal Insurance USA to Robert Plan Corp.</p>
</text>
